# ==========================================================================
# Repository rule: NEVER commit .env* or *.md files.
#   - 任何 env 文件（含 .env / .env.* / *.env / 各层目录）
#   - 任何 markdown 文件（含 README.md / docs 笔记）
# Enforced by .githooks/pre-commit and .githooks/pre-push.
# ==========================================================================

# --- env files: never published -------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env

# --- markdown: never published --------------------------------------------
*.md
**/*.md

# --- markdown 配套的调研素材（截图/CSV/脚本），与 md 一同留在本地 ----------
docs/

# --- OS / editor -----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

# --- python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
backend/data/
backend/:memory:

# --- node / frontend build -------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
dist/
**/dist/
.vite/
**/.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- UI 原型工具产物 -------------------------------------------------------
ui/.file-versions/
ui/.od-frames/
ui/.od-skills/
*.artifact.json
